name: ['Abrupt Decay', 'Advent of the Wurm', 'Agrus Kos, Wojek Veteran', 'Armada Wurm', 'Aurelia, the Warleader', 'Bomber Corps', 'Boros Charm', 'Boros Elite', 'Boros Garrison', 'Boros Keyrune', 'Boros Reckoner', 'Boros Signet', 'Boros Swiftblade', 'Brightflame', 'Call of the Conclave', 'Call of the Nightwing', 'Centaur Healer', 'Cerebral Vortex', 'Char', 'Circu, Dimir Lobotomist', 'Consuming Aberration', 'Daring Skyjek', 'Darkblast', 'Deadbridge Chant', 'Deadbridge Goliath', 'Deathrite Shaman', 'Devouring Light', 'Dimir Aqueduct', 'Dimir Charm', 'Dimir Doppelganger', 'Dimir Guildmage', 'Dimir Signet', 'Dinrova Horror', 'Djinn Illuminatus', 'Drown in Filth', 'Dryad Militant', 'Electrickery', 'Electrolyze', 'Elves of Deep Shadow', 'Etrata, the Silencer', 'Firemane Angel', 'Firemane Avenger', 'Forest', 'Frenzied Goblin', 'Gather Courage', 'Gaze of Granite', 'Gelectrode', 'Glare of Subdual', 'Glimpse the Unthinkable', 'Goblin Rally', 'Golgari Charm', 'Golgari Rot Farm', 'Golgari Signet', 'Grave-Shell Scarab', 'Grisly Salvage', 'Grove of the Guardian', 'Growing Ranks', 'Guttersnipe', 'Hour of Reckoning', 'Hypersonic Dragon', 'Invoke the Firemind', 'Island', 'Izoni, Thousand-Eyed', 'Izzet Boilerworks', 'Izzet Charm', 'Izzet Signet', 'Jarad, Golgari Lich Lord', 'Korozda Guildmage', 'Last Gasp', 'Lazav, Dimir Mastermind', 'Legion Loyalist', 'Lightning Helix', 'Lotleth Troll', 'Loxodon Hierarch', 'Martial Glory', 'Master Warcraft', 'Mirko Vosk, Mind Drinker', 'Mizzium Mortars', 'Moroii', 'Mountain', 'Netherborn Phalanx', 'Nightveil Specter', 'Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind', 'Nivix Guildmage', 'Plains', 'Pollenbright Wings', 'Privileged Position', 'Putrefy', 'Pyromatics', 'Razia, Boros Archangel', 'Ribbons of Night', 'Savra, Queen of the Golgari', 'Scatter the Seeds', 'Selesnya Charm', 'Selesnya Evangel', 'Selesnya Guildmage', 'Selesnya Sanctuary', 'Selesnya Signet', 'Shambling Shell', 'Shattering Spree', 'Sisters of Stone Death', 'Slum Reaper', 'Spark Trooper', 'Stinkweed Imp', 