text: ["({G/W} can be paid with either {G} or {W}.)\\nOther permanents you control have hexproof. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", '({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', '({U/B} can be paid with either {U} or {B}.)\\n{3}{U}: Target player draws a card. Activate only as a sorcery.\\n{3}{B}: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '({U/R} can be paid with either {U} or {R}.)\\nFlying\\nEach instant and sorcery spell you cast has replicate. The replicate cost is equal to its mana cost. (When you cast it, copy it for each time you paid its replicate cost. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', "At the beginning of your upkeep, populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", 'Battalion — Whenever Bomber Corps and at least two other creatures attack, Bomber Corps deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Battalion — Whenever Boros Elite and at least two other creatures attack, Boros Elite gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Battalion — Whenever Daring Skyjek and at least two other creatures attack, Daring Skyjek gains flying until end of turn.', "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Cast this spell only before attackers are declared.\\nYou choose which creatures attack this turn.\\nYou choose which creatures block this turn and how those creatures block.', 'Char deals 4 damage to any target and 2 damage to you.', 'Choose one —\\n• All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Regenerate each creature you control.', 'Choose one —\\n• Boros Charm deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n• Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\\n• Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\n• Izzet Charm deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n• Draw two cards, then discard two cards.', "Choose one —\\n• Counter target sorcery spell.\\n• Destroy target creature with power 2 or less.\\n• Look at the top three cards of target player's library. Put one back and the rest into that player's graveyard.", 'Choose one —\\n• Draw X cards.\\n• Invoke the Firemind deals X damage to any target.', 'Choose one —\\n• Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\\n• Exile target creature with power 5 or greater.\\n• Create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance.', 'Choose target creature. Mill four cards, then that creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each land card in your graveyard.', "Consuming Aberration's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your opponents' graveyards.\\nWhenever you cast a spell, each opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nCreate three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nDestroy all nontoken creatures.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nExile target attacking or blocking creature.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.", 'Create a 1/1 blue and black Horror creature token with flying.\\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', 'Create a 3/3 green Centaur creature token.', 'Create a 5/5 green Wurm creature token with trample.', "Create a token that's a copy of target artifact or creature.\\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)", 'Create four 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value X or less.', "Destroy target artifact or creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target artifact or enchantment, then populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B}.", 'Double strike', 'Electrickery deals 1 damage to target creature you don\'t control.\\nOverload {1}{R} (You may cast this spell for its overload cost. If you do, change "target" in its text to "each.")', 'Electrolyze deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.\\nDraw a card.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has flying.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, create that many 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', "Etrata, the Silencer can't be blocked.\\nWhenever Etrata deals combat damage to a player, exile target creature that player controls and put a hit counter on that card. That player loses the game if they own three or more exiled cards with hit counters on them. Etrata's owner shuffles Etrata into their library.", 'Flip a coin. If you win the flip, take an extra turn after this one.', 'Flying, first strike\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Firemane Angel is in your graveyard or on the battlefield, you may gain 1 life.\\n{6}{R}{R}{W}{W}: Return Firemane Angel from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your upkeep.', 'Flying, haste\\nYou may cast sorcery spells as though they had flash. (You may cast them any time you could cast an instant.)', 'Flying, vigilance, haste\\nWhenever Aurelia, the Warleader attacks for the first time each turn, untap all creatures you control. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', 'Flying, vigilance, haste\\n{T}: The next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature you control this turn is dealt to another target creature instead.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life.', 'Flying\\nBattalion — Whenever Firemane Avenger and at least two other creatures attack, Firemane Avenger deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nIf Szadek, Lord of Secrets would deal combat damage to a player, instead put that many +1/+1 counters on Szadek and that player mills that many cards.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Mirko Vosk, Mind Drinker deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal four land cards, then puts those cards into their graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Nightveil Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.\\nYou may play lands and cast spells from among cards exiled with Nightveil Specter.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Stinkweed Imp deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature.\\nDredge 5 (If you would draw a card, you may mill five cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Draw a card.', "Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{G}.", "Haste\\nBattalion — Whenever Legion Loyalist and at least two other creatures attack, creatures you control gain first strike and trample until end of turn and can't be blocked by creature tokens this turn.", "Hexproof\\nWhenever a creature card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, you may have Lazav, Dimir Mastermind become a copy of that card, except its name is Lazav, Dimir Mastermind, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has hexproof and this ability.", 'If an instant or sorcery card would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.', "Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{R}.", "Jarad, Golgari Lich Lord gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your graveyard.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Sacrifice another creature: Each opponent loses life equal to the sacrificed creature's power.\\nSacrifice a Swamp and a Forest: Return Jarad from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand, one on top of your library, and one on the bottom of your library.', 'Mizzium Mortars deals 4 damage to target creature you don\'t control.\\nOverload {3}{R}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its overload cost. If you do, change "target" in its text to "each.")', 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{T}: Create Voja, a legendary 2/2 green and white Wolf creature token.', 'Radiance — Brightflame deals X damage to target creature and each other creature that shares a color with it. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Replicate {1}{R} (When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you paid its replicate cost. You may choose new targets for the copies.)\\nPyromatics deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Replicate {2}{U} (When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you paid its replicate cost.)\\nCreate a 3/3 blue Weird creature token with defender and flying. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Replicate {R} (When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you paid its replicate cost. You may choose new targets for the copies.)\\nDestroy target artifact.', 'Return target card from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Treasured Find.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. If {G} was spent to cast this spell, that creature enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature or land card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', 'Ribbons of Night deals 4 damage to target creature and you gain 4 life. If {U} was spent to cast this spell, draw a card.', 'Sacrifice Shambling Shell: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nDredge 3 (If you would draw a card, you may mill three cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', "Scavenge {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a number of +1/+1 counters equal to this card's power on target creature. Scavenge only as a sorcery.)", "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Tap target artifact or creature.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards in your hand.', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\nDredge 3 (If you would draw a card, you may mill three cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', "Target player draws two cards, then Cerebral Vortex deals damage to that player equal to the number of cards they've drawn this turn.", 'Target player mills ten cards.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nDestroy target nonland permanent with mana value 3 or less.", 'Trample, lifelink, haste\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Spark Trooper.', 'Trample\\nDiscard a creature card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Lotleth Troll.\\n{B}: Regenerate Lotleth Troll.', 'Trample\\nWhen Armada Wurm enters the battlefield, create a 5/5 green Wurm creature token with trample.', 'Undergrowth — When Izoni, Thousand-Eyed enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 black and green Insect creature token for each creature card in your graveyard.\\n{B}{G}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Until end of turn, target creature loses all abilities and becomes a red Weird with base power and toughness 0/1.\\nFuse (You may cast one or both halves of this card from your hand.)', 'When Centaur Healer enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', "When Deadbridge Chant enters the battlefield, mill ten cards.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, choose a card at random in your graveyard. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", "When Dinrova Horror enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand, then that player discards a card.", 'When Loxodon Hierarch enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.\\n{G}{W}, Sacrifice Loxodon Hierarch: Regenerate each creature you control.', 'When Netherborn Phalanx enters the battlefield, each opponent loses 1 life for each creature they control.\\nTransmute {1}{B}{B} ({1}{B}{B}, Discard this card: Search your library for a card with the same mana value as this card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. Transmute only as a sorcery.)', 'When Slum Reaper enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever Agrus Kos, Wojek Veteran attacks, attacking red creatures get +2/+0 and attacking white creatures get +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Boros Reckoner is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to any target.\\n{R/W}: Boros Reckoner gains first strike until end of turn.', "Whenever Frenzied Goblin attacks, you may pay {R}. If you do, target creature can't block this turn.", "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain life equal to that creature's toughness.\\n{1}{G}{W}, {T}: Populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", "Whenever you cast a blue spell, exile the top card of target player's library.\\nWhenever you cast a black spell, exile the top card of target player's library.\\nYour opponents can't cast spells with the same name as a card exiled with Circu, Dimir Lobotomist.", 'Whenever you cast a blue spell, target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\nWhenever you cast a red spell, Tibor and Lumia deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you sacrifice a black creature, you may pay 2 life. If you do, each other player sacrifices a creature.\\nWhenever you sacrifice a green creature, you may gain 2 life.', '{1}, Sacrifice Grave-Shell Scarab: Draw a card.\\nDredge 1 (If you would draw a card, you may mill a card instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', '{1}, {T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', "{1}{B}{G}: Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains intimidate until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\\n{2}{B}{G}, Sacrifice a nontoken creature: Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{1}{R}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Create a 1/1 red and white Soldier creature token with haste.', '{1}{U}{B}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Dimir Doppelganger becomes a copy of that card, except it has this ability.', '{1}{U}{R}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{G}: Target creature blocks Sisters of Stone Death this turn if able.\\n{B}{G}: Exile target creature blocking or blocked by Sisters of Stone Death.\\n{2}{B}: Put a creature card exiled with Sisters of Stone Death onto the battlefield under your control.', '{T}: Add {B}. Elves of Deep Shadow deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}{W}, {T}, Tap two untapped creatures you control, Sacrifice Grove of the Guardian: Create an 8/8 green and white Elemental creature token with vigilance.', '{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\\n{R}{W}: Boros Keyrune becomes a 1/1 red and white Soldier artifact creature with double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', '{T}: Exile target land card from a graveyard. Add one mana of any color.\\n{B}, {T}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard. Each opponent loses 2 life.\\n{G}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. You gain 2 life.', '{T}: Gelectrode deals 1 damage to any target.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may untap Gelectrode.']
flavor: ['"(Z—>)90° — (E—N²W)90°t = 1"', '"All matter, animate or not, rots when exposed to time. We merely speed up the process."\\n—Ezoc, Golgari rot farmer', '"Allow me a moment to catch your breath."', '"Dangerous to recognize. Deadly not to."\\n—Lazav', '"Diametrically opposing energies in self-sealed plasmodermic bubbles make great pets!"\\n—Trivaz, Izzet mage', '"Even this primitive specimen of my kind is impressive."\\n—Niv-Mizzet', '"Fear not. Your life will not go unlived."', '"First, you must fight among the rank and file. It is there I will discern your skills as a leader."\\n—Aurelia, to Gideon Jura', '"Have you ever held a Boros signet? There\'s a weight to it that belies its size—a weight of strength and of pride."\\n—Agrus Kos', '"I am confident that if anyone actually penetrates our facades, even the most perceptive would still be fundamentally unprepared for the truth of House Dimir."\\n—Szadek', '"I have lived long, and I remember how this city once was. If my death serves to bring back the Ravnica in my memory, then so be it."', '"Imagine a thunderstorm that\'s also a tactical genius. That\'s him."\\n—Dars Gostok, Firefist captain', '"Let the pyres of the unbelievers light our way."\\n—Razia', '"Let the rest of Ravnica sneer. One way or another, they all end up in the undercity."\\n—Jarad', '"My favorite meal is angel\'s flesh, slain in agony and iced with black vinegar."\\n—Aszala of House Dimir', '"Nature\'s most raw beauty is the circle: perfect in its continuance, with no break between death and life."', '"One day every pillar will be a tree and every hall a glade."\\n—Trostani', '"Patience, mage. Killing you now would be too easy."', '"Ravnica, like a hedge, must be pruned, leaving only leaves of verdant uniformity."\\n—Niszka, Selesnya evangel', '"Subtlety is for lawmages and spies."', '"The clamor of the city drowns all voices. But together we can sing a harmony that will resonate from Ravnica\'s tallest spires to her deepest wells."', '"The hard part isn\'t landing in the saddle. The hard part is leaping before you see it."', '"The only action worth taking is one with an unknown outcome."', '"Touched by moroii"\\n—Undercity slang meaning "to grow old"', '"We in the Conclave have a saying: \'When you hold a shield, lend your shield.\' The strong must never forget what they owe to the weak."\\n— Niszka, Selesnya evangel', '"We will defend the Worldsoul from Izzet \'progress\' at any cost."', '"We will grow an army large enough to withstand the Izzet\'s madness."\\n—Trostani', '"Welcome to the Dimir Public Offices. Not responsible for death or loss of property. Basement off-limits."\\n—Sign outside Dinrova Building', '"Yes, Boros tactics are unparalleled. But when your comrades are dying around you, inner strength must carry the day."\\n—Gideon Jura, to Aurelia', 'After fear and weakness rot away, that which remains is stronger than its living form.', 'An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members—and the doomed.', 'Cast out of the Conclave generations ago, these elves found a home in the corrupted districts of the Golgari.', 'Centaurs are sent to evangelize in Gruul territories where words of war speak louder than prayers of peace.', 'Depending on your point of view, the seal represents a proud guardian of the natural cycle or one who has sold her soul to darkness for eternal life.', 'Firemane Nevena led the victorious assault on the Barbu Rooftop rebels. Now the Gateless have marked her for death.', 'From the seeds of faith, great forests grow.', 'Golgari reclaimers resent the gorgons, begrudging the loss of so many fine nutrients locked away in stone.', 'Gorgons crave beautiful things: gems, exquisite amulets, the alabaster corpses of the petrified dead . . .', 'He lurks in the undercity, eager for the corpse haulers to unload their rotting cargo.', 'He wants to watch Ravnica burn, one soul at a time.', 'Her sword burns with such brightness that foes avert their eyes and arrows divert their paths.', 'Instructors at the Kasarna training grounds are capable healers in case their students fail to grasp the subtleties of combat.', 'Into the light the good are welcomed, and with the light the evil are banished.', 'Izzet brains and Izzet boilers: contents under pressure.', 'Izzet mages often acquire their magic reagents from dubious sources, so the potency of their spells is never predictable.', 'Izzet-designed conductors atop Sunhome charge empty sets of armor that give form to the fluctuating elementals.', 'Lieutenant Kos has never met a group of recruits he could not inspire or a mob he could not quell.', 'Mastery is achieved when "telling time" becomes "telling time what to do."', 'No one in the Conclave acts alone.', 'Only in Ravnica do the wolves watch the flock.', 'Quyzl was told by his mentor to "make more time" for his studies.', 'Some Golgari insects live for centuries—and they never stop growing.', 'Sunhome—the stalwart shield, the towering sentinel, the seat of justice.', 'The Gruul seek unbounded strength. The Dimir deliver cruel irony.', 'The Izzet learn something from every lesson they teach.', 'The Izzet quickly suspended their policy of lifetime guarantees.', 'The Izzet signet is redesigned often, each time becoming closer to a vanity portrait of Niv-Mizzet.', 'The clouds grew thick, and then they grew teeth.', "The consciousness of Mat'Selesnya does not always spread in peaceful ways.", 'The outskirts of Golgari territory are guarded by more than just walls.', 'The righteous light of Selesnya is channeled through the devout, striking out to blind the nonbelievers.', "The rot farmer's first rite of passage is to craft a pair of work stilts.", 'The symbol of the Conclave is one of unity, with tree supporting sun and sun feeding tree.', "The upside to not thinking about the consequences is that you'll always surprise those who do.", 'There are no soloists in the chorus of Selesnya.', "Though less well-known than its army of soldiers, the Boros Legion's mage-priests are as respected by the innocent as they are hated by the ghosts of the guilty.", 'To the Golgari, anything buried is treasure.', 'To those in tune with the Firemind, there is no difference between knowledge and flame.', 'Tracing the horizon in a dance of wind and fire.', 'When the Boros Legion attacks, swiftblades enter the fray first. They pick off the archers and mages, softening the enemy front before the flame-kin and giants go in.', 'Where Razia was aloof and untouchable, Aurelia is on the frontlines, calling for war.', "You don't so much hire goblins as put ideas in their heads."]
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Despain', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chase Stone', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Rush', 'Clint Cearley', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dave Dorman', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Staples', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason Chan', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jim Murray', 'Joel Thomas', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jon Foster', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Mike Sass', 'Min Yum', 'Nic Klein', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pat Lee', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Pete Venters', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
